# AWS-only dependencies, installed in the lambda and aws_proxied images (and the
# tests image) on top of requirements.txt. Keep them out of requirements.in so
# the cloudrun, generic and azure images don't carry them.
-c requirements.txt
-c requirements-lambda.txt
